m><strong>Adam Driver</strong></em></a> talks about upcoming X Men villain role. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://consequence.net/2026/11/snl-christmas-episode-timothee-chalamet-charli-xcx/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>SNL</strong></em></a> announces next batch of hosts. </p>\n<p>Apple TV does a deep dive on <a href=\"https://youtu.be/sDMNuKvCXOc?is=z4r_9J9bZjGDHRnr\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>Justin Timberlake</strong></em></a> in a four part series. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://people.com/florida-drive-thru-worker-of-37-years-who-got-epic-send-off-featured-in-new-netflix-doc-exclusive-12267892\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>Netflix</strong></em></a> does a deep dive on a Florida drive Thru worker. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/es/news/ni66125461/?ref_=nwc_art_perm\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>Gabriel Iglesias</strong></em></a> says he is fine after leaving mid show because of an illness. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://deadline.com/2026/11/ted-lasso-renewed-season-5-apple-tv-1237231022/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Ted Lasso</em></strong></a> gets a fifth season. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://variety.com/2026/film/news/steven-spielberg-western-cillian-murphy-jessie-buckley-1236956084/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>Steven Spielberg’s</strong></em></a> western is coming together quickly. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.the-independent.com/arts-entertainment/films/features/rob-lowe-maga-democrats-sex-scandal-b3090140.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>Rob Lowe</strong></em></a> stars in a new Ben Shapiro flick and people are questioning it. </p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ew.com/billy-bob-thornton-stuns-fox-and-friends-hosts-zodiac-signs-birthdays-12275809\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong>Billy Bob Thorton</strong></em></a> creeps out Fox &amp; Friends. </p>